        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-02-04T17:19:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote><p>How do we know this isn't just spiff's houserule?</p></blockquote><p>Spiff doesn't put any houserules in that FAQ at all.&nbsp; Even the stuff without a reference link in the FAQ actually does have a reference link somewhere on the forum or BGG, but by the time I started adding them to the FAQ, I couldn't go back and find them all.&nbsp; If anyone cared enough, they should be able to dig up references for everything in there (if you do this, please send them to me so I can add them to the FAQ).</p>",
