        "created_at": "2014-02-04T17:31:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, that should be clarified somewhere in a sticky post. &nbsp;Spiff's FAQ is all stuff that's been verified by one of The Three at some point in time. &nbsp;Spiff isn't just some guy that made an FAQ, he's the guy that made THE FAQ, you can take pretty much anything in there as gospel.</p>",
